{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c477","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a087b3-56b9-7060-8f60-96db20969afb"},"sequence":150,"recorded_at":1780531400000295,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"b50cb893-1a9e-463b-98b6-7c1306fa57ef","payload_type":"tool.result","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"tool_result","command_id":"b50cb893-1a9e-463b-98b6-7c1306fa57ef","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"b50cb893-1a9e-463b-98b6-7c1306fa57ef"},"call_id":"call_01a087b397407602a93be17b3ab2af52","text":"Read text file `/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.temp/resources/TASK-260830-21gygk/TASK-260830-21gygk_results.md`.\n1|# TASK-260830-21gygk results — v0.6.0 selector grammar, source resolution, selection plans\n2|\n3|Run: RUN-260909-c41bb6 (developer) · Story worktree `.temp/STORY-260830-3tq4ns/worktree`\n4|Branch: `task-board/story/STORY-260830-3tq4ns` at `7208cc7427e1ebe95106d34f98214e2bbea4ae1c` (unmoved; candidate UNCOMMITTED)\n5|Authority: relux-works/agent-session-manager-spec v0.6.0 commit `0cbdf100dbf84df50c64f792b1f940e3a67859a6`\n6|Scope: §§14.7/14.7.1 + shared SelectionPlan construction/revalidation in §14.7.2, refining §2.3 and §§5.7/14.7.3\n7|\n8|## AC coverage: 8 of 8 rows driven at the shared library boundary\n9|\n10|| AC row | Production call site | Named test(s) |\n11|| --- | --- | --- |\n12|| Bare UUID/name selectors (§2.3 tiers preserved) | `Reader.Resolve` → `resolveBare` | `TestResolvePinnedPrecedence`, `TestResolveLocalNameAndUUID`, `TestResolveBareIdentityUnion`, `TestResolveAllowlistAndReadFailures` |\n13|| Qualified selectors (first-`@`, no fallback) | `Reader.Resolve` → `resolveExplicit` → `locateSource` | `TestResolveQualifiedSourcesSelectOneIndex`, `TestResolveQualifiedSourceNeverFallsBack`, `TestResolveQualifiedNameBeforeUUIDInSource`, `TestResolveExplicitSourceRefusals`, `TestResolveExplicitSourceReadFailures` |\n14|| Ambiguity | `matchName`; `selectIdentity`/`checkRecordAgree