ttery re-derived on the final tree (`/tmp/sel-mutants-final`, mutants.json);\n34|  per-mutant logs preserved alongside it. Earlier identical run `/tmp/sel-mutants-01`.\n35|\n36|## Mutant table (all KILLED; token-preserving grammar mutants marked *)\n37|\n38|| Mutant | Result | Killing test |\n39|| --- | --- | --- |\n40|| N-collision-pair | KILLED | TestResolveExactNamesAndASCIICollisions |\n41|| N-case-variant | KILLED | TestResolveExactNamesAndASCIICollisions |\n42|| N-parked-id | KILLED | TestParkedReadRecoveryAndMissingVsMalformed |\n43|| N-tombstoned-id | KILLED | TestResolveExcludesTombstonedButListsIt |\n44|| N-unlisted-peer | KILLED | TestResolveAllowlistAndReadFailures |\n45|| N-duplicate-peer | KILLED | TestResolveAllowlistAndReadFailures |\n46|| N-read-failure-fallback | KILLED | TestRevalidateReadFailures, TestResolveAllowlistAndReadFailures |\n47|| N-projection-failure-fallback | KILLED | TestRevalidateDetectsEachFactChange, TestListStatusCheckpointAndProjectionFailure |\n48|| N-repository-case-variant | KILLED | TestResolveLocalNameAndUUID |\n49|| N-first-at-split * | KILLED | TestParseSelectorLiteralGrammar |\n50|| N-local-prefix * | KILLED | TestParseSelectorLiteralGrammar |\n51|| N-id-case * | KILLED | TestParseSelectorLiteralGrammar |\n52|| N-peer-alias-fold | KILLED | TestSelectorConfigurationValidation/alias_casing_is_exact |\n53|| N-id-through-names | KILLED | TestResolveQualifiedNameBeforeUUIDInSource |\n54|| N-explicit-fallback | KILLED | TestResolveQualifiedSourceNeverFallsBack |\n55|| N-unknown-alias-local | KILLED | TestResolveExplicitSourceRefusals |\n56|| N-disallowed-admit | KILLED | TestResolveExplicitSourceRefusals |\n57|| N-dup-alias | KILLED | TestSelectorConfigurationValidation/duplicate_alias_mapping |\n58|| N-rev-revocation | KILLED | .../revocation_refuses_allowlist |\n59|| N-rev-config | KILLED | .../unrelated_mapping_change_changes_configuration |\n60|| N-rev-binding | KILLED | .../alias_remap_changes_binding |\n61|| N-rev-index